      "created_at": "2018-04-15T23:34:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-15T23:35:20Z",
      "body": "If it's not an option, it should be the default then.  This should\r\nbe reopened.\r\n\r\nLook at what a, maybe the, most popular free software for traffic\r\nanalysis does for ip address privacy: https://matomo.org/docs/privacy/\r\n\r\nThe current situation is frankly a horrible default for privacy and\r\nshould never have been made that way in the first place, and it's still worth\r\ncorrecting.\r\n\r\nAfaik, what I've suggested is not possible with the plugin api.\r\n",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
