      "created_at": "2018-04-18T11:07:57Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-18T11:07:57Z",
      "body": "Just wondering if anyone knows how the big names are handling this?  One big draw of all shorteners is the data collected.  What do Google and Bitly do? Did they stop collecting this kind of data? It seems many YOURLS data collection features are in some way copied from the big boys.",
