      "body": "@Teki: Thanks, this is a quick hack, which overrides the filter for getting IPs and user agents and makes them return empty strings. Alas, geolocation is not possible any more and so no country code will be stored. But it is in my opinion enough to anonymize YOURLS, since a precise click time is no personal data without IP and/or user agent.",
