      "created_at": "2018-05-24T10:24:22Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-05-24T10:24:22Z",
      "body": "To get rid of the Referer I also added this to anonymize-log:\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nfunction anonymized_logging_redirect( $value, $keyword ) {\r\n\tglobal $ydb;\r\n\t$table = YOURLS_DB_TABLE_LOG;\r\n\t\r\n\t$now      = date( 'Y-m-d H:i:s' );\r\n\t$keyword  = yourls_escape( yourls_sanitize_string( $keyword ) );\r\n\t\r\n\treturn $ydb->query( \"INSERT INTO `$table` (click_time, shorturl, referrer, user_agent, ip_address, country_code) VALUES ('$now', '$keyword', '', '', '', '')\" );\r\n}\r\n\r\nyourls_add_filter('shunt_log_redirect', 'anonymized_logging_redirect');\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
      "reactions": {
